WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.780
<i>From the town where I was born and raised,</i>

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:06.780
<i>you could see Mt. Fuji.</i>

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:09.500
<i>It was so big and beautiful,</i>

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.790
<i>it always helped clear my mind...</i>

00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:16.060
<i>Sometimes, after staring at it for a while,</i>

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:18.700
<i>I wouldn't want to go home anymore.</i>

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:26.250
<b>Yakiniku     Daruma       Offal</b>

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.840
<i>On the ground floor of our house,</i>

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:26.250
<i>our father ran a small yakiniku restaurant.</i>

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.490
<i>It was always dark inside,</i>

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:31.590
<i>and the oil hung thick in the air.</i>

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:34.850
<i>The pillars, the walls,</i>

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:36.940
<i>even our furniture...</i>

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:39.940
<i>Everything was covered in a layer of yellow oil.</i>

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:43.440
<i>Since our mom was gone,
no one took care of it,</i>

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:47.900
<i>to the point that there was a steadily growing
layer of fat on the futons in the closet.</i>

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:50.550
<i>No matter how many
times I tried to wash things,</i>

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:52.280
<i>the fat would come back.</i>

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:55.900
<i>To make matters worse,
my dad was incredibly oily himself,</i>

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:59.620
<i>and would always give off 
this uniquely fatty smell.</i>

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.490
<i>I also had a brother
who was two years older.</i>

00:01:03.490 --> 00:01:05.590
<i>He had a warped personality,</i>

00:01:05.590 --> 00:01:09.620
<i>and whenever Dad wasn't around,
he would bully me violently.</i>

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:13.580
<i>He also had a strange habit...</i>

00:01:13.580 --> 00:01:16.240
<i>Every now and then,
he'd sneak into the kitchen</i>

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:18.780
<i>and drink vegetable oil 
like he was enjoying it...</i>

00:01:25.490 --> 00:01:27.850
You saw, didn't you, Yui?

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:31.180
Listen up. You better not tell Dad!

00:01:31.180 --> 00:01:34.160
You know what I'll do to you
if you do, don't you?

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:41.080
<i>The sticky walls,</i>

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:43.700
<i>the disgusting smell of my father,</i>

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:46.010
<i>and my brother, who was as
disgusting as the fat itself...</i>

00:01:46.010 --> 00:01:47.450
<i>I hated it all.</i>

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:51.710
<i>I started to get more
and more sensitive to oil.</i>

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:59.960
<i>I was eventually able to tell how 
saturated the air in a room was.</i>

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:08.850
<b>50% Saturation</b>

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:01.650
<i>Oil saturation.</i>

00:02:01.650 --> 00:02:06.460
<i>That's the term I used to describe
how thick the air was with oil.</i>

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:08.850
Ding dong ding dong...

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:12.590
The current oil saturation is at 50%.

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:15.820
Please be cautious around open flame.

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:20.280
The current saturation level is 60%.

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:23.300
The current saturation level is 60%...

00:03:57.790 --> 00:03:59.970
<i>When my brother entered puberty,</i>

00:03:59.970 --> 00:04:02.550
<i>he started getting
pimples on his forehead.</i>

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:06.180
<i>They spread from there
to the rest of his face.</i>

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:11.730
Come on, he'll hear you!

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:15.560
Hey, Goro, stay the hell away from us!

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:17.620
Your whole face looks
like it's about to erupt!

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:20.000
Idiot!

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:22.260
You got your gross oil on us!

00:04:22.260 --> 00:04:23.840
You better pay for the cleaning!

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:38.670
<b>Yakiniku     Daruma       Offal</b>

00:04:35.820 --> 00:04:37.330
Hey, Yui!

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:38.670
You laughed, didn't you?!

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:41.430
You thought I deserved it, didn't you?!

00:04:41.430 --> 00:04:42.840
Stop it, Goro!

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:44.600
Let go, Dad!

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:48.850
It's your fault my face is 
like this in the first place!

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:52.900
My whole body is polluted with all this oil!

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:54.990
What the hell are you gonna do about it?!

00:04:54.990 --> 00:04:56.390
Stop it, Goro!

00:04:56.390 --> 00:04:57.100
Damn it!

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:58.160
Enough!

00:04:59.810 --> 00:05:03.220
<i>After that, my brother shut
himself up in his room</i>

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:05.910
<i>and drank oil every day.</i>

00:05:06.980 --> 00:05:07.950
Yui?

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:09.210
Yui!

00:05:09.210 --> 00:05:10.930
Where the hell are you, Yui?!

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:13.290
What is it, Onii-chan?

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:14.530
Oil!

00:05:14.530 --> 00:05:16.210
Go buy some more.

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:18.630
And a new futon.

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:21.510
This one is so sticky, it's disgusting.

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:25.890
I know, but Dad won't give me any money...

00:05:25.890 --> 00:05:27.210
Shut up!

00:05:27.210 --> 00:05:29.350
There's gotta be some somewhere.

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:32.390
Ugh, I'm so pissed off!

00:05:34.780 --> 00:05:36.100
Gross!

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:39.020
Did you...

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:41.730
just say I was gross?

00:05:42.710 --> 00:05:44.110
I see...

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:47.490
You hate my oil that much?

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:50.690
I'll give you a big taste, then!

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:05.810
How's that?!

00:06:05.810 --> 00:06:08.800
All that oil coming up from my volcanoes!

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:10.560
Serves you right!

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:13.070
All of you, always making a fool out of me!

00:06:13.070 --> 00:06:15.810
You just wait and see... I'll kill you all.

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:19.360
And you get to go first,

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:22.320
as punishment for calling me gross!

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:43.910
Sorry, Goro...

00:06:46.930 --> 00:06:49.510
You want to go to Yakiniku Daruma?

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:51.120
No way!

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:52.850
That place is filthy.

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:57.860
No, actually, I went the other day 
and the meat was amazing.

00:06:57.860 --> 00:06:59.270
Really fatty!

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:00.270
Really?

00:07:00.270 --> 00:07:03.020
<b>Daruma</b>

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:02.420
Welcome!

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:06.920
Mister, give me some of that tasty meat.

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:08.260
The kind from the other day.

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:11.380
I'm sorry.

00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:15.320
We actually ran out of that meat yesterday.

00:07:15.320 --> 00:07:16.650
Really?

00:07:16.650 --> 00:07:18.410
Y-Yeah...

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:21.580
The current oil saturation is 70%...

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:23.380
70%.

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:29.510
<i>It was then that I started
having odd dreams.</i>

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:34.580
<i>In my dream,</i>

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:36.700
<i>I was looking at Mt. Fuji.</i>

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:50.880
Oil...

00:07:50.880 --> 00:07:52.110
It's oil!

00:07:57.800 --> 00:08:01.810
<i>The oil saturation is currently 90%.</i>

00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:05.300
<i>Oil saturation is 90%.</i>

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:09.840
<i>Please be extremely
cautious around open flame.</i>

00:08:12.070 --> 00:08:14.300
I feel so gross...

00:08:16.330 --> 00:08:17.250
Oh, no!

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:21.740
<i>More and more pimples
began to appear on my face.</i>

00:08:21.740 --> 00:08:23.220
<i>And so,</i>

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:25.520
<i>I started hiding inside, too.</i>

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:27.810
Yui?

00:08:27.810 --> 00:08:30.210
Still not feeling better?

00:08:30.210 --> 00:08:32.550
Why not take a walk or something?

00:08:32.550 --> 00:08:34.950
Shut up! Go away!

00:08:35.650 --> 00:08:38.770
The current saturation is 80%....

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:41.330
80%.

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:58.960
Drink it! Drink it, Yui!

00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:04.110
What are you doing?!

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:06.690
Yui, you're awake?

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:07.990
Sorry.

00:09:07.990 --> 00:09:11.630
I thought you might be hungry,
so I gave you some oil.

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:14.670
Even if I was hungry,
I wouldn't want to drink oil!

00:09:14.670 --> 00:09:16.190
I guess that's right.

00:09:16.190 --> 00:09:18.280
You didn't drink oil, did you?

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:24.090
Wait... Have you been making me 
drink it all the time lately?

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:25.570
Nah...

00:09:25.570 --> 00:09:27.810
You have, haven't you?

00:09:27.810 --> 00:09:28.960
You're crazy.

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:31.090
I'm off to bed.

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:34.560
<i>It's true...</i>

00:09:34.560 --> 00:09:36.210
<i>I know it's true.</i>

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:38.830
<i>The last few days,</i>

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:41.630
<i>Dad has been making me drink oil.</i>

00:09:42.490 --> 00:09:45.060
<i>From that point on, I took precautions.</i>

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:47.980
<i>I couldn't sleep without being careful...</i>

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:57.700
<b>Due to circumstances,
we are temporarily closed</b>

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:04.300
I'm done! I'm done with all of it!

00:10:04.300 --> 00:10:06.680
Who gives a damn about yakiniku anyway?

00:10:06.930 --> 00:10:10.010
<i>My father became even greasier,</i>

00:10:10.010 --> 00:10:13.930
<i>and even getting close to him would
make the saturation level rise.</i>

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:21.220
<i>There would be a layer of grease
in the bath after he used it,</i>

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:26.420
<i>and more oil had soaked into
his futon than ever before.</i>

00:10:27.280 --> 00:10:29.010
<i>Then, one night...</i>

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:31.810
What's that sound?

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:47.200
<i>What dribbled down to the floor wasn't blood,</i>

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:49.480
<i>but golden-brown oil.</i>

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:53.920
<i>The current saturation level is 100%...</i>

00:10:54.310 --> 00:10:57.000
<i>Saturation level 100%.</i>

00:10:57.010 --> 00:11:02.010
<b>Greased</b>

00:10:57.010 --> 00:11:02.010
Collection No. 107

00:11:07.780 --> 00:11:10.670
<i>My grandmother,
who lives in the country alone,</i>

00:11:10.670 --> 00:11:12.180
<i>seems to be afraid lately.</i>

00:11:12.180 --> 00:11:14.440
<i>She asked for someone,
anyone, to come over.</i>

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:38.760
This place is always gloomy
whenever I visit.

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:48.770
<i>Who would be here at this hour?</i>

00:11:49.410 --> 00:11:51.440
<i>A friend of Grandma's?</i>

00:11:57.490 --> 00:11:58.860
Good evening.

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:02.110
Excuse me, but do you
know my grandmother?

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:06.170
I thought as much.

00:12:06.170 --> 00:12:08.710
She's been here since last year
when my grandfather died,

00:12:08.710 --> 00:12:13.040
and we've all been worried about her,
staying here all by herself.

00:12:13.220 --> 00:12:15.550
Please keep visiting her.

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:26.890
<b>Bridge</b>

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:26.890
Collection No. 026

00:12:28.730 --> 00:12:30.490
Grandma, open up!

00:12:30.490 --> 00:12:32.160
It's me! Kanako!

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:35.490
Grandma! Grandma!

00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:37.620
Is that you, Kana?

00:12:37.620 --> 00:12:39.150
Let me just open this up.

00:12:45.400 --> 00:12:47.600
Grandma, what was that?!

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:50.530
Well, that's Kingoro-san.

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:53.300
He's my uncle

00:12:53.300 --> 00:12:57.500
who died long ago,
when I was just a child.

00:12:57.780 --> 00:13:00.090
He's out there every night...

00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:02.230
Out there on the bridge.

00:13:02.520 --> 00:13:06.560
Since your grandpa died and 
I'm the only one here now,

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:09.480
those things pop out every night.

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:11.710
Are you saying they're ghosts?!

00:13:11.710 --> 00:13:15.830
They must've been
waiting for me to be alone.

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:24.260
The ghosts are calling for me...

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:26.590
But... there are so many voices.

00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:30.270
A lot of people have died in this village.

00:13:30.270 --> 00:13:32.490
Many haven't passed on.

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:34.950
Why would they want you?

00:13:34.950 --> 00:13:36.710
Well, dear...

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:40.580
They want to drag me down into the river.

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:42.260
Take a look.

00:13:42.260 --> 00:13:43.920
They're waving for me.

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:48.710
Osode-chan!

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:53.860
Osode-chan!

00:13:54.010 --> 00:13:56.600
Osode-chan!

00:14:00.530 --> 00:14:05.490
They call all night long.
I can barely get any sleep.

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:09.490
I doubt you can sleep here either, Kana,

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:14.550
so I'll tell you a story
from when I was young.

00:14:14.550 --> 00:14:16.960
Take a seat and hear me out.

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:20.660
I think this'll be the first
time I've told you about it...

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:25.320
You see, I was born and raised in this house,

00:14:25.320 --> 00:14:28.160
and have spent my whole life here.

00:14:28.160 --> 00:14:30.960
There's hardly anyone left,

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:35.670
but in the old days,
this village was pretty lively.

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:39.610
Back then, there was an
odd tradition, though...

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:42.480
How we handled our funerals.

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:50.420
The first instance I can remember
was during Kingoro-san's funeral.

00:14:51.010 --> 00:14:55.200
The day of the funeral, everyone in 
the village met at the edge of the river

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:57.640
to see off the dead.

00:14:58.260 --> 00:15:02.330
I remember watching from
the edge with my mother.

00:15:03.240 --> 00:15:06.610
Hey! Kingoro-san is headed this way!

00:15:06.610 --> 00:15:09.210
Osode, your uncle is coming.

00:15:09.210 --> 00:15:11.090
Let's get a good look at him.

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:36.130
He ran into the edge of the bridge.

00:15:36.130 --> 00:15:38.160
Kingoro-san sure has bad luck.

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:40.370
Your uncle fell!

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:42.320
Oh, the poor thing!

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:44.680
Hey, Mom,

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:47.030
what's going to happen to Uncle Kingoro?

00:15:47.030 --> 00:15:51.850
The river widens out there,
on top of being deeper...

00:15:51.850 --> 00:15:54.480
He won't drift downstream.
He's going to sink there.

00:15:54.480 --> 00:15:58.640
If he had just stayed on the mat, he still 
would've been able to float on to heaven!

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:02.490
Can't we at least tie them to the mats?

00:16:02.490 --> 00:16:06.180
Sad as it is, that's tradition.

00:16:07.810 --> 00:16:09.890
Shokichi-san was...

00:16:09.890 --> 00:16:10.850
Shokichi-san?

00:16:10.850 --> 00:16:16.210
Well, Shokichi-san was a young
man who died at the age of 20.

00:16:16.670 --> 00:16:22.570
He was also the last person put to rest 
by sending his body down the river.

00:16:22.570 --> 00:16:25.510
I was 16 at the time.

00:16:25.510 --> 00:16:29.360
Shokichi-san was the biggest
man in the village.

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:32.330
Goodness, he must've
been over two meters tall.

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:36.220
But his heart was as soft as cotton.

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:40.290
He was my first love...

00:16:40.820 --> 00:16:42.850
and my fiance.

00:16:43.290 --> 00:16:47.650
But some trees collapsed on him 
in the mountains, and he passed on.

00:16:48.430 --> 00:16:51.960
At the funeral, we used two mats...

00:16:51.960 --> 00:16:53.650
Okay, let's get him flowing!

00:16:53.650 --> 00:16:56.420
I was so sad, I was beside myself,

00:16:56.420 --> 00:17:01.120
but a lot of the other villagers
thought it'd be quite the show.

00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:04.030
Look, Osode's actually crying.

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:05.200
Can you blame her?

00:17:05.510 --> 00:17:07.130
He's floating this way!

00:17:10.180 --> 00:17:11.980
Shokichi-san...

00:17:14.890 --> 00:17:16.210
It's gonna hit!

00:17:23.940 --> 00:17:24.720
Look!

00:17:24.720 --> 00:17:29.790
Shokichi's body is too big, 
and since it's stiff, he's stuck!

00:17:37.380 --> 00:17:39.960
Hey, you young folks!

00:17:39.960 --> 00:17:41.670
Do something!

00:17:41.670 --> 00:17:43.870
Don't you feel sorry for poor Shokichi?!

00:17:56.100 --> 00:17:58.210
At the time,

00:17:58.210 --> 00:18:03.320
it felt like Shokichi had his eyes open 
and was looking at me.

00:18:03.320 --> 00:18:04.740
At you?

00:18:04.740 --> 00:18:09.500
I wonder if he was telling me something...

00:18:10.640 --> 00:18:12.080
That's right...

00:18:12.080 --> 00:18:15.230
His eyes were telling me to come soon.

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:20.660
The people who fell into the 
river must be waiting for me.

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:24.770
That's why the ghosts appear
every night and call me.

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:27.360
I'm so scared...

00:18:34.880 --> 00:18:39.400
Osode-chan!

00:18:40.740 --> 00:18:43.170
Osode-chan!

00:18:43.170 --> 00:18:44.650
Kana, dear,

00:18:44.650 --> 00:18:47.890
I don't think I'm going to last much longer.

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:50.100
What are you saying, Grandma?!

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:52.820
You only think that because
you've been here alone so long!

00:18:52.820 --> 00:18:54.780
Let's leave tomorrow!

00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:57.350
It's too late.

00:18:57.350 --> 00:18:59.110
I'm going to die.

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:01.360
Grandma! Snap out of it!

00:19:01.360 --> 00:19:02.440
Kana, dear,

00:19:02.440 --> 00:19:05.910
if I die, bury me in the ground.

00:19:06.180 --> 00:19:10.420
No matter what happens,
don't float me down the river.

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:13.630
I don't want to sink into the river...

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:17.640
Kana, dear, I'm counting on you...

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:19.640
Grandma?

00:19:19.640 --> 00:19:21.770
Grandma, what's wrong with you?!

00:19:21.770 --> 00:19:23.120
Grandma!

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:24.620
Grandma?!

00:19:24.620 --> 00:19:26.880
Please, Grandma!

00:19:32.720 --> 00:19:34.460
Oh...

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:36.880
It was just a dream.

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:38.960
I get it.

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:43.440
I must've gotten sleepy on the way
and taken a little nap.

00:20:06.780 --> 00:20:08.410
Creepy...

00:20:08.410 --> 00:20:10.640
Just like in my dream.

00:20:18.490 --> 00:20:20.210
<i>It can't be.</i>

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:29.370
Good evening.

00:20:31.980 --> 00:20:33.800
Osode-san...

00:20:34.800 --> 00:20:37.820
just passed away.

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:44.960
Grandma!

00:20:44.960 --> 00:20:47.120
Grandma, where are you?!

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:48.910
Grandma?

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:03.450
Look, here comes Osode-chan!

00:21:04.980 --> 00:21:07.810
Osode-chan...

00:21:08.470 --> 00:21:13.960
Osode-chan!

00:21:15.450 --> 00:21:18.430
Osode-chan...

00:21:21.790 --> 00:21:23.690
How wonderful.

00:21:23.690 --> 00:21:27.620
Now Shokichi and Osode
can finally be married.

00:21:27.620 --> 00:21:31.650
But Osode-chan has gotten quite old.

00:21:32.070 --> 00:21:35.370
Grandma! Grandma!

00:21:41.700 --> 00:21:45.610
<i>It seemed like she was looking at me...</i>

00:23:23.360 --> 00:23:35.010
Osode-chaaaan

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:39.980
Collection
